{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-6","name":"教師","text":"よし\r\n授業、始めるぞー","trans":"好\n开始上课了——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-7","name":"教師","text":"まずは、テストの返却から","trans":"首先，从发试卷开始","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-9","name":"教師","text":"名前を呼ばれた人は\r\n取りに来るように──","trans":"被叫到名字的人\n上来拿一下——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010040","name":"甜花","text":"（……たぶん……\r\nよくない、やつ……）","trans":"（……大概……\n是不好的那种……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010050","name":"甜花","text":"（…………\r\nいいやつ、ないけど……）","trans":"（…………\n好的那种，没有呢……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-13","name":"教師","text":"──次、大崎ー","trans":"——下一个，大崎——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-25","name":"教師","text":"──じゃあ、今日はここまで","trans":"——那么今天就到这里","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-26","name":"教師","text":"テストの成績が悪かった者は\r\nしっかりと復習しておくようにー","trans":"考试成绩不好的同学\n要好好复习一遍——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-28","name":"生徒１","text":"テスト、どうだった？","trans":"考试，怎么样？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-29","name":"生徒２","text":"全然ダメだった\r\nヤマがことごとく外れてて","trans":"完全不行\n猜的题全都没中","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-30","name":"生徒１","text":"私もー……\r\n復習、一緒にやらない？","trans":"我也是——……\n要不要一起复习？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010100","name":"甜花","text":"（……復習……\r\nしなきゃ、だよね……）","trans":"（……复习……\n必须得做吧……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010110","name":"甜花","text":"あ……","trans":"啊……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010120","name":"甜花","text":"……にへへ","trans":"……嘿嘿","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010130","name":"甜花","text":"（お昼の、時間だ……！）","trans":"（到，午休时间了……！）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-46","name":"生徒３","text":"ねー、甘奈ー\r\nこないだ言ってた新しいリップ、もう買った？","trans":"喂——甘奈——\n之前说的新口红，你买了吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010140","name":"甘奈","text":"ううん\r\nまだ～","trans":"没有\n还没呢～","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-48","name":"生徒４","text":"そっかー\r\n買ってたら、感想とか聞きたかったんだけどなー","trans":"这样啊——\n要是买了，还想问问你感想呢——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010150","name":"甘奈","text":"あ、それなら今週末、\r\nみんなで見にいってみない？","trans":"啊，那这个周末，\n大家一起去看看怎么样？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-51","name":"生徒３","text":"いいねー！\r\nテストも終わったし、気晴らしだ！","trans":"不错呢——！\n考试也结束了，正好散散心！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-52","name":"生徒４","text":"ついでにどこかで甘いもの食べたい！\r\n新しい店開拓したいんだよねー","trans":"顺便想在哪里吃点甜的！\n想开拓一下新店呢——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010160","name":"甘奈","text":"うんっ！\r\nえへへ、楽しみだね～","trans":"嗯！\n嘿嘿，好期待呢～","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010180","name":"甘奈","text":"じゃあ、甘奈はここで～","trans":"那甘奈就在这里～","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-60","name":"生徒３","text":"うん、ばいばーい","trans":"嗯，拜拜——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010190","name":"甘奈","text":"（えへへ）","trans":"（嘿嘿）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010200","name":"甘奈","text":"──甜花ちゃーん！","trans":"——小甜花","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010210","name":"甜花","text":"あ……\r\nなーちゃん……！","trans":"啊……小奈……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010220","name":"甘奈","text":"お待たせ～！\r\nお弁当、どこで食べる？","trans":"久等了～！\n便当在哪里吃？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010230","name":"甜花","text":"…………\r\nここで、いい……","trans":"…………\n在这里，就好……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010240","name":"甘奈","text":"えへへ\r\n了解だよ～","trans":"嘿嘿\n知道了～","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010250","name":"甜花","text":"（えと……\r\nお弁当……）","trans":"（那个……\n便当……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010260","name":"甘奈","text":"？\r\n甜花ちゃん、何か落ちたよ","trans":"？\n甜花，你掉了什么哦","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010270","name":"甜花","text":"……！\r\nそ、それ──","trans":"……！\n那、那个——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010290","name":"甜花","text":"え、えと……\r\nさっき……返された、テスト……","trans":"那、那个……\n刚才……发回来的，试卷……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010300","name":"甘奈","text":"帰ったらお勉強だね～","trans":"回去要学习呢～","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010320","name":"甘奈","text":"甘奈も一緒にやるから、ね？","trans":"甘奈也一起做，好吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010341","name":"甘奈","text":"そうだ！\r\n帰りにプリン買おうよ！","trans":"对了！\n回去的时候买布丁吧！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010350","name":"甜花","text":"……！\r\n……プリン……","trans":"……！\n……布丁……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010360","name":"甘奈","text":"美味しいお店、見つけたの\r\n甜花ちゃんにも食べてほしいな～","trans":"我发现了一家好吃的店\n也想让甜花尝尝呢～","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010380","name":"甘奈","text":"お勉強終わったら\r\nご褒美に、ね？","trans":"等学习结束了\n就当作奖励，好吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010400","name":"甘奈","text":"えへへ、決まりだねっ","trans":"嘿嘿，就这么定了！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010401","name":"甘奈＆甜花","text":"……えへへ","trans":"……嘿嘿","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010410","name":"甘奈","text":"じゃ、食べよっか","trans":"那，吃吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010420","name":"甜花","text":"……うん","trans":"……嗯","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010430","name":"甘奈","text":"美味しいねっ","trans":"真好吃呢！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010450","name":"甜花","text":"（なーちゃんは……）","trans":"（甘奈她……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010460","name":"甜花","text":"（いつも、甜花のこと……\r\n気にしてくれて……）","trans":"（总是，把甜花的事……\n放在心上……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010470","name":"甘奈","text":"もうちょっとで今日のノルマクリアだよ！\r\n頑張ろ～！","trans":"再差一点就完成今天的任务了！\n加油吧～！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010480","name":"甜花","text":"（勉強も……\r\n教えて、くれる……）","trans":"（学习也……\n教给我……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010490","name":"甘奈","text":"えへへ、\r\n頑張った後のプリン、格別だね～","trans":"嘿嘿，\n努力之后的布丁，特别好吃呢～","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010500","name":"甜花","text":"（……いつも\r\n一緒にいて……）","trans":"（……总是\n在一起……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010510","name":"甘奈","text":"甜花ちゃーん！\r\nこの敵強いよ～！　助けて～！","trans":"甜花——！\n这个敌人很强哦～！　救救我～！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010520","name":"甜花","text":"（たまに、一緒にゲームも\r\nやってくれる……）","trans":"（偶尔，也会陪我\n一起玩游戏……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010530","name":"甘奈","text":"（甜花ちゃんと）","trans":"（和甜花一起）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010540","name":"甘奈","text":"（こうやって一緒にお弁当を食べて）","trans":"（像这样一起吃便当）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010550","name":"甜花","text":"あと……\r\nちょっとで……終わる……！","trans":"还差……\n一点……就结束了……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010560","name":"甘奈","text":"（お勉強をして）","trans":"（一起学习）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010570","name":"甜花","text":"にへへ……\r\n美味しい……","trans":"嘿嘿……\n好吃……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010580","name":"甘奈","text":"（プリンを食べて）","trans":"（一起吃布丁）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010590","name":"甜花","text":"なーちゃん……\r\nそいつは……任せて……！","trans":"甘奈……\n这家伙……交给我……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010600","name":"甘奈","text":"（一緒に遊ぶ）","trans":"（一起玩）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010601","name":"甘奈＆甜花","text":"アイドルになる前","trans":"在成为偶像之前","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010610","name":"甜花","text":"甜花の……\r\n一番大きな『好き』は、なーちゃんで……","trans":"甜花……\n最喜欢的，就是甘奈……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4001065010620","name":"甘奈","text":"甘奈の一番大きな『好き』は甜花ちゃんだった","trans":"甘奈最喜欢的就是甜花","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}